# Secrets for the Sim Bridge relay on Cloudflare Workers.
# The "Deploy to Cloudflare" button asks for these; for a manual deploy use
#   npx wrangler secret put SIM_BRIDGE_ACCESS_KEY
#
# The owner key: a new random secret of at least 32 characters. Keep it private;
# your Android phone needs it once to create the bridge. Generate one with
#   openssl rand -base64 36
SIM_BRIDGE_ACCESS_KEY=""
